  https://www.statista.com/statistics/580087/energy-use-of-facebook-meta/
  https://www.statista.com/statistics/788540/energy-consumption-of-google/
    FaceBook (now Meta) in 2022: 11.51 Tera-Wh (4.14e+16 Joules)
    Google in 2023: 25.911 Tera-Wh (9.32e+16 Joules)
  https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2024/09/openai-asked-us-to-approve-energy-guzzling-5gw-data-centers-report-says/
